---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — Griffith Creative | AI-First Web Design Agency"
  description="Griffith Creative is a boutique web design and SEO agency based in Los Angeles, serving businesses across the US. AI-driven workflows deliver agency-grade websites at a fraction of the cost."
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 fade-in">
          About
        </p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight mb-6 fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          Built different.<br />
          On purpose.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
          Griffith Creative is a boutique web design and SEO agency based in Los Angeles, serving businesses across the country. We exist because the traditional agency model is broken — and we decided to fix it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story -->
  <section class="bg-dark-secondary py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
        <div class="fade-in">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">The problem we saw.</h2>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Small and mid-sized businesses were getting squeezed. Big agencies charge $15K–$40K for websites that take three to six months to deliver. Freelancers are cheaper but unreliable. DIY builders look cheap and rank poorly.
          </p>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-base leading-relaxed">
            The result? Businesses stuck with outdated websites that don't generate leads, don't rank in search, and don't reflect the quality of the work they actually do.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">What we do about it.</h2>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
            We built Griffith Creative around one idea: use modern tools and AI-accelerated workflows to deliver the same caliber of work that large agencies produce — faster and at a fraction of the cost.
          </p>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-base leading-relaxed">
            We're not cutting corners. We're cutting overhead. No bloated project teams, no endless revision cycles, no layers of account management between you and the people building your site. You talk to us. We build it. It ships.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Approach -->
  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16 fade-in">
        <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
          Our Approach
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold">
          AI-first doesn't mean autopilot.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-dark-secondary p-8 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5 fade-in">
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-lg mb-3">AI-Accelerated, Human-Directed</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We use AI to handle the repetitive parts of web development and content creation — templating, initial drafts, code scaffolding, image optimization. This lets us focus our human expertise on strategy, design decisions, and the details that actually matter to your business.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-dark-secondary p-8 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5 fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Performance-Obsessed</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Every site we build targets a perfect 100 on Google PageSpeed. We use static-first architecture, edge deployment, and modern image formats. Your visitors get a fast experience. Google rewards you with better rankings.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-dark-secondary p-8 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5 fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-lg mb-3">SEO as Architecture</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            SEO isn't a plugin or an add-on. It's how we structure every site from the ground up — semantic HTML, proper heading hierarchy, schema markup, optimized meta tags, internal linking strategy, and content that answers what your prospects are actually searching for.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-dark-secondary p-8 rounded-lg border border-offwhite/5 fade-in fade-in-delay-3">
          <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Built for Business Owners</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We build websites for businesses that depend on trust and reputation. That focus means we understand what your customers expect, how they search, and what makes them pick up the phone or fill out a form.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="bg-dark-secondary py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto fade-in">
        <p class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
          What We Stand For
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-12">
          Principles over process.
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Transparent Pricing</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              You'll know exactly what you're paying before we write a single line of code. No scope creep invoices, no surprise fees, no "we'll figure it out as we go."
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Speed Without Sacrifice</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              We deliver in weeks, not months. But fast doesn't mean sloppy. Every site is code-reviewed, performance-tested, and SEO-audited before launch.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Minimal Client Overhead</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              You're busy running a practice or firm. We don't need twelve meetings and a shared Slack channel. One discovery call, a review cycle, and you're live.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Results Over Aesthetics</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Your site should look great — and it will. But design awards don't pay the bills. We optimize for the metrics that matter: rankings, traffic, and conversions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 text-center fade-in">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">
        Let's build something<br />that actually works.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
        No pitch decks. No discovery phases that last longer than your lease. Just a conversation about what your business needs and how we get there.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block bg-accent text-black font-bold px-10 py-4 rounded hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors text-lg"
      >
        Start a Conversation
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
